,["ARC or PLC in Caddo County","/arc-plc/oklahoma/caddo-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle got 24% of normal in January to February, then 240% in March to April. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 21% on the middle, and grid 18427 still has its driest year in 1954 at 49%.</p>"}
